      "comment": "RED HOT WREN (1) is a handily bred pup making her debut without a trial. Expected to measure up. NOT TOO PROUD (4) turned spotting a big start finishing eighth (19.30) last time in a Maiden at this track. Safe beginner but has a tricky box to overcome. Has ability and can atone. SPEAK TO ME (7) comes off an average effort last start when fifth at this track over 320m behind Winsome Way (19.89) in a Maiden. Placed at her previous run. Safe beginner but wide box to overcome and will need some luck. Can figure in the finish. BIG TOWN JADE (5) is an improver who can finish much closer after missing a cheque at this track when making debut.",
